				57,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Echo): Add repository and architecture doc links to crate root\n\nAppend a `## Links` section to the module-level doc comment in Source/Library.rs with direct GitHub links to the Echo repository and the Architecture.md design document.\n\nThis gives developers browsing the documentation an immediate path to the source repository and architectural overview without leaving rustdoc.",
			"SHA": "27b52caaedc248a372e0c62556497dbcce9bb27a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T00:05:44Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				57,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Echo): Overhaul README with streamlined structure and ecosystem focus\n\nRewrite README.md to deliver a more scannable, ecosystem-oriented introduction. Flatten decorative tables and emoji-heavy headers into compact plain-markdown sections, squashing multi-line paragraphs into single lines for readability. Reorganize the narrative flow: remove the redundant project-structure-ASCII-tree in favor of a \"Key Components\" table, promote the architecture principles table above the Mermaid diagram, and consolidate \"Getting Started\" and \"Usage\" into a single section.\n\nAdd a dedicated \"In the Land Project\" section explaining Echo's concrete role as the Mountain backend execution engine. Create a \"Related Documentation\" section that surfaces all ecosystem links (Architecture Overview, Deep Dive, Land docs, Mountain, Common, CHANGELOG) in one place. Wrap \"Contributing\" and \"TODO\" into a slimmed-down call for contributions.\n\nCondense the Funding section — remove the four-column partner logo table and decorative horizontal rules, replacing them with inline SVG image references and terser explanation text. Drop the \"Project Maintainers\" footer and the standalone \"Changelog\" section (CHANGELOG link is now in Related Documentation).\n\nThe result is a cleaner, faster-to-scan README that puts Echo's architectural role and ecosystem relationships front and center.",
			"SHA": "00555412c04946aafcc42b81e07f5b19c16fa0df"
		},
